      "writtenOn": "2017-11-17T18:58:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, I can generate from the same list a string of patterns for make. Some modules now use only Android.bp or Android.mk file, so I tried to keep two lists instead of one larger unified list.\nShorter lists should save some search time in make and soong.\n\nSince this short list contains prefix of paths, a cross HasPrefix match with a long list of all existing paths would take longer time than comparing with a short list of modules that have not used -Werror. Current wall_werror.txt dump shows that WarningsAreAllowed is only called less than 70 times,\nfor modules added -Wall or -Werror.",
      "parentUuid": "c282e801_95276c08",
      "revId": "70ed3296c049d6537f8702bb82e87785bb64b5d2",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
